{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57158","headline":"率题六章 第五章劝请仁贤背苦就乐 · 傅翕","name":"率题六章 第五章劝请仁贤背苦就乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愿子从爲善，名价身爲呈。\n诸天散花下，飞梵来相迎。\n同昇珍宝殿，处处皆光明。\n共居常乐境，齐悦证无生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}